# JUSTIN — "No Audience"
# Member file. Seed var: var.music (lyrics / instrumental / silence).
# Record 07: a silent dance video. The unresolved subject stands in the doorway (seen only in the mirror).

=== justin_intro
@show justin smile at=c
@cam wide
> Justin is not standing still. Justin, it becomes clear, does not really do standing still.
> While Songha reads the fire-exit map out loud, he's working a small pattern into the lobby tiles. Heel, toe, slide. So quietly the sneakers barely squeak.
> There's a carton of strawberry milk in his hoodie pocket. The straw is already in.
@show hyunjun thinking at=l
hyunjun: That's mine.
justin: It's ours. Everything's ours tonight. Daniel said.
hyunjun: Daniel said we could talk *comfortably*. He didn't say anything about my milk.
justin[laugh]: It was implied.
@hide hyunjun
> Hyunjun gives up with the air of someone who has lost this exact argument many, many times, and goes to complain to Hamin, who hands him a biscuit without looking up.
@cam closeup justin
justin: {{playerName}}! Hi. Okay. Quick, before Songha makes us sign something.
> He spins once — a small one this time, just enough to land pointing both hands at you.
justin: Rate it. Out of ten. Be honest. Actually, don't be honest. Be nice.
* [playful] "Seven. You wobbled."
    @rel justin closeness+1
    justin[surprised]: I did *not*—
    justin[laugh]: …I wobbled a little. The tiles are wet. I'm blaming the tiles.
* [sincere] "Ten. I didn't even see how you did it."
    @rel justin trust+1
    justin[shy]: Oh. Okay. That's— thanks. That's a real answer. I wasn't ready for a real answer.
* [quiet] Clap. Twice. Slowly.
    @rel justin closeness+1
    @sfx clap
    justin[laugh]: The slow clap. Brutal. I respect it.
> He pulls the headphones off his neck and turns them over in his hands, like he's checking they're still his.
justin[smile]: Okay, real question. Important. It tells me everything about a person.
justin: What do you listen to at two in the morning?
* [playful] "Songs with words. Loud ones. I sing along badly."
    @var music = "lyrics"
    @rel justin closeness+1
    justin[laugh]: Yes. Correct. Bad singing is the best singing. Nobody's grading you at two a.m.
* [sincere] "Instrumentals. Words get in the way when I'm thinking."
    @var music = "instrumental"
    @rel justin trust+1
    justin[thinking]: Huh. So the music leaves room, and you fill in the rest yourself.
    justin: …That's a nice way to listen. I'm stealing it.
* [quiet] "Nothing. I like it quiet."
    @var music = "silence"
    @rel justin trust+1
    > For a second he doesn't have a joke ready. You watch him look for one.
    justin[thinking]: …Me too, sometimes.
    justin[smile]: Don't tell anyone. It's terrible for my image.
justin: Anyway. ECHO says I have a record. I know exactly which one. A video. Me, dancing, sound off.
justin[laugh]: Best case, it's art. Worst case, it's four minutes of a guy breathing loudly in an empty room.
@if flag.told_worked_here
    justin[thinking]: You worked the desk here, right? I rented the practice room once. Really late.
    justin: Someone stayed up to lock the door after me. I never said thank you properly.
@else
    justin[thinking]: I rented the practice room here once. Really late. Someone had to stay up to lock the door after me.
    justin: I never said thank you properly.
> He says it lightly, then looks at the ceiling a beat too long, like he's counting something up there.
@show haruta smile at=l
haruta: Justin. Songha is asking whether you're "stretching or causing problems."
justin: Both. Tell him both.
haruta[laugh]: I'll tell him stretching.
@hide haruta
justin[smile]: Okay, I have to go be responsible for eleven seconds. Talk later?
> He backs away across the lobby, still facing you, and very nearly walks into the sofa. He turns it into a spin. Mostly.
@hub act1

