        @rel justin romance+1
        > You ask with a look. He turns his hand over before you've finished asking.
        > You tap the counts. You're a little off on six. He doesn't correct you, which for him is enormous.
        justin[smile]: …Really off on six. Do it again later. I'll count with you.
