    @rel justin trust+1 closeness+1
    > It puts you below the line of his act. He glances down at you mid-gesture and loses his place.
@cam closeup justin
you: You don't have to perform for me.
> It lands somewhere. You can see exactly where.
> His hands come down. His shoulders come down. For a moment he looks like the kid in the video, just after the doorway: stopped, not frozen.
justin[neutral]: …Yeah.
